y_lato"><div id="header" class="header"><h1 itemprop="name" class="game_title">The White on the Map</h1></div><div id="view_html_game_5451727" class="view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready"><div id="html_embed_5761280" class="html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper"><div data-width="640" data-height="360" style="width: 640px; height: 360px" class="game_frame game_pending"><div data-iframe="&lt;iframe scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/19063353/index.html?v=1788287394&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;" class="iframe_placeholder"><button class="button load_iframe_btn"><svg stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" role="img" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="svgicon icon_play" aria-hidden stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" version="1.1" width="24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8"></polygon></svg> Run book</button></div></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="left_col column"><div class="formatted_description user_formatted"><p>The White on the Map is Book II of the Trace of Refusal trilogy from the Pantheon of Declarative Art.</p>
<p>Twenty-seven people sent to inspect water beyond the perimeter. All returned to the official log marked NEVER DEPARTED. The map is white where the river still is.</p>
<p>Start with Book I:</p>
<p><a href="https://alexar76.itch.io/the-weight-of-the-answer">https://alexar76.itch.io/the-weight-of-the-answer</a></p>
<p>Formats: EPUB · browser HTML</p>
<p>Languages: English · Russian · Español · Français · 中文</p>
